# Screenshots Directory

Add screenshots of each tab here with the following naming convention:

- dashboard.png
- jobs-list.png
- gantt-view.png
- cost-analytics.png
- health.png
- cluster-analysis.png
- ai-assistant.png
- reports.png
- settings.png

To take screenshots:
1. Open the app: https://databricks-jobs-monitor-1602460480284688.aws.databricksapps.com
2. Navigate to each tab
3. Use your OS screenshot tool (Cmd+Shift+4 on Mac, Win+Shift+S on Windows)
4. Save screenshots with the names above
